Hi Sam,

In the future, if you have your laptop or other personal items sitting out =
on a table and it looks like people want to use that space, you can always =
just communicate with them, "here let me grab that so you can use that area=
", it wouldn't lead to any awkward situations and would allow you to move y=
our belongings out of the way to a safer location while acknowledging that =
they want to use the space.  It wouldn't imply that you don't trust them, b=
ut would also not put your own personal belongings in harms way in that sit=
uation.

[cid:image001.jpg@01DB7619.6B7B1510]Logan Bliss | Volunteer Services Lead/R=
anger 1
